.TH AUDIO_FREE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
audio_free \- Release a Sound's samples and zero it
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqaudio.h\(dq
.BI "void audio_free(Sound *s);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Release a Sound's samples and zero it. Do not free a sound that is currently the music (call audio_music_stop() first); effects already playing keep playing, since their samples were copied into the mixer.
.SH MODULE
audio (src/engine/audio/audio.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR audio_load (3),
.BR audio_music_stop (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
